parameters.text:
=Analyze this week's developer community pulse across multiple platforms.

Topics focus: {{ $('Set Pulse Config').item.json.topics }}

Hacker News Top Stories:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Fetch HN Story').all().map(i=>({title:i.json.title,score:i.json.score,url:i.json.url}))) }}

Reddit ML/AI Posts:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Fetch Reddit Dev Pulse').item.json.data?.children?.slice(0,5).map(p=>({title:p.data.title,score:p.data.score,subreddit:p.data.subreddit}))) }}

Dev.to Articles:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Fetch Dev.to Trending').item.json?.slice(0,5).map(a=>({title:a.title,reactions:a.positive_reactions_count,tags:a.tag_list}))) }}

Return JSON:
{
  "hottest_topics": [],
  "developer_concerns": [],
  "tools_being_discussed": [],
  "tutorials_in_demand": [],
  "controversies": [],
  "consensus_emerging": [],
  "community_mood": "excited/cautious/frustrated/neutral",
  "what_to_build_based_on_demand": [],
  "weekly_pulse_summary": "3-4 sentence summary of developer community this week"
}

=💻 *Weekly Dev Community Pulse*

*Community mood:* {{ $json.community_mood }}

{{ $json.weekly_pulse_summary }}

*Hottest topics:*
{{ $json.hottest_topics.slice(0,4).map(t=>`• ${t}`).join('\n') }}

*What devs want to learn:*
{{ $json.tutorials_in_demand.slice(0,3).map(t=>`• ${t}`).join('\n') }}

*Build opportunities:*
{{ $json.what_to_build_based_on_demand.slice(0,2).map(b=>`• ${b}`).join('\n') }}
